Sprint outcome

Sprint 16 hardens external dependency behavior without adding a circuit breaker. The system now has explicit retry-exhaustion semantics, fail-closed stale-cache behavior, bounded startup dependency checks, deterministic failure injection, dependency restoration tests, and a repeatable verification gate.

